  <p>Sends "Pragma: no-cache" header (<a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/TRUE" target="_blank">TRUE</a>), or does not send a "Pragma" header (<a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/FALSE" target="_blank">FALSE</a>).</p>
